{"4228940": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Chaotic Dungeon", "steam_appid": 4228940, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to the Chaotic Dungeon: a place where you can never predict what will happen next. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As an ordinary person who accidentally entered this place, you need to struggle to survive in the constantly changing environment, collect weapons and items, and eventually defeat the boss. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Escape from here.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >                                                                                 <strong>Watch Your Step</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4228940/extras/04303a39c4683ff1de572b7b9f887318.poster.avif?t=1772203437\" width=854 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4228940/extras/04303a39c4683ff1de572b7b9f887318.webm?t=1772203437\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4228940/extras/04303a39c4683ff1de572b7b9f887318.mp4?t=1772203437\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Environmental elements can interact with each other: The candle might ignite the oil stains on the ground, leading to an explosion and triggering more traps. Everything will become increasingly chaotic.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >                                                                                 <strong>Walk together</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4228940/extras/af51c1c6ec20d468f4e3a31e9485a909.poster.a